+/**************************************
+ *
+ *	s t o r e _ i n d i c e s
+ *
+ **************************************
+ *
+ * Functional description
+ *	Add system indices. If odsVersion is specified, then we are performing
+ *	an ODS update, so add only the indices marked as newer than odsVersion.
+ *
+ **************************************/
+	SET_TDBB(tdbb);
